[Main]
Name=BBPower
Title=Сила быков/медведей
Group=Алгоритмы

[Input]
open=row
close=row
high=row
low=row

[Output]
bulls=row,@bulls
bears=row,@bears

[InputPars]
Start
Size

[Code]
<gvars>
double @bulls[], @bears[];

<lines>
  ArrayInit(@bulls, $Size);
  CheckShift(@bulls);
  ArrayInit(@bears, $Size);
  CheckShift(@bears);
  
  for (int i=$Start; i<$Size-1; i++)
  {
    if ($close[i]>$open[i])
    {
      @bulls[i] = $high[i] - $low[i];
      @bears[i] = $open[i] - $low[i] + $high[i] - $close[i];
    }
    else
    {
      @bulls[i] = $high[i] - $open[i] + $close[i] - $low[i];
      @bears[i] = $high[i] - $low[i];
    }
  }

[Help]
Индикатор показывает силу быков и медведей по каждой свече.

